		{"id":"memory","type":"text","text":"**TradingMemoryLog**\n(`agents/utils/memory.py`)\n\n- `store_decision(ticker, trade_date, final_trade_decision)` → entry **pending**\n- `get_past_context(ticker)` → iniettato a inizio run\n- `_resolve_pending_entries(ticker)` (next same-ticker run)\n- file: `memory_log_path` (markdown)","x":-1020,"y":2160,"width":360,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"init_state","type":"text","text":"**Initial State** — `Propagator.create_initial_state`\n\n- `company_of_interest`, `asset_type`, `trade_date`\n- `past_context` ← `TradingMemoryLog.get_past_context()`\n- `messages = [(\"human\", company_name)]`\n- `investment_debate_state` (count=0), `risk_debate_state` (count=0)\n- `market_report = sentiment_report = news_report = fundamentals_report = \"\"`","x":-1510,"y":-1920,"width":750,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# TradingAgents — Grafo LangGraph\n_Estratto da `tradingagents/graph/setup.py` + `agent_states.py` (2026-05-28)_","x":-1600,"y":-2080,"width":800,"height":80},
		{"id":"start","type":"text","text":"**START**\n`StateGraph(AgentState)`","x":-300,"y":-1560,"width":260,"height":80,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"config","type":"text","text":"**DEFAULT_CONFIG** (`default_config.py`)\n\n- `llm_provider`, `deep_think_llm`, `quick_think_llm`, `backend_url`\n- `max_debate_rounds=1`, `max_risk_discuss_rounds=1`, `max_recur_limit=100`\n- `analyst_concurrency_limit=1`, `checkpoint_enabled=False`\n- `data_vendors{}`, `tool_vendors{}`, `benchmark_map{}`, `output_language`\n- Env: `TRADINGAGENTS_*`","x":280,"y":-1480,"width":540,"height":280,"color":"3"},
