		{"id":"cond_analyst","type":"text","text":"**`ConditionalLogic.should_continue_<key>`**\n\n```\nif last_message.tool_calls:\n    return tools_<key>\nreturn Msg Clear <Label>\n```\n\nApplicato a tutti i 4 analyst node.\n\nKey valide: `market`, `social`, `news`, `fundamentals`.","x":550,"y":-1045,"width":320,"height":359,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"state_v1","type":"text","text":"**AgentState dopo gli analisti**\n\n- `messages` (con tool call/response)\n- `market_report`, `sentiment_report`, `news_report`, `fundamentals_report`\n- `sender` aggiornato\n- `company_of_interest`, `trade_date`, `asset_type`, `past_context` invariati","x":910,"y":-1045,"width":460,"height":359,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bull","type":"text","text":"**Bull Researcher**\n_quick LLM_\n→ aggiorna `investment_debate_state.bull_history`, `current_response`, `count`","x":-1880,"y":-60,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"bear","type":"text","text":"**Bear Researcher**\n_quick LLM_\n→ aggiorna `investment_debate_state.bear_history`, `current_response`, `count`","x":-1600,"y":280,"width":320,"height":120,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"rm","type":"text","text":"**Research Manager**\n_**deep LLM**_\n\nOutput strutturato: `ResearchPlan`\n→ writes `investment_plan`\n→ writes `investment_debate_state.judge_decision`\n\n`render_research_plan` → markdown","x":-1220,"y":-40,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"schema_rp","type":"text","text":"**`ResearchPlan`** (Pydantic)\n\n- `recommendation: PortfolioRating`\n- `rationale: str`\n- `strategic_actions: str`","x":-760,"y":200,"width":240,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"cond_debate","type":"text","text":"**`should_continue_debate`**\n\n```\nif count >= 2*max_debate_rounds:\n    → Research Manager\nelif current_response.startswith(\"Bull\"):\n    → Bear Researcher\nelse:\n    → Bull Researcher\n```","x":-740,"y":-40,"width":440,"height":160,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"trader","type":"text","text":"**Trader**\n_quick LLM_\n\nLegge `investment_plan` + 4 report\nOutput strutturato: `TraderProposal`\n→ writes `trader_investment_plan`","x":-1080,"y":660,"width":320,"height":180,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"schema_tp","type":"text","text":"**`TraderProposal`**\n\n- `action: TraderAction (Buy/Hold/Sell)`\n- `reasoning: str`\n- `entry_price?, stop_loss?: float`\n- `position_sizing?: str`\n\n`render_trader_proposal` → markdown\n(trailing FINAL TRANSACTION PROPOSAL line)","x":-620,"y":530,"width":400,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"aggr","type":"text","text":"**Aggressive Analyst**\n_quick LLM_\n→ `risk_debate_state.aggressive_history`, `current_aggressive_response`, `latest_speaker=\"Aggressive\"`, `count++`","x":0,"y":980,"width":280,"height":120,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"cons","type":"text","text":"**Conservative Analyst**\n_quick LLM_\n→ `risk_debate_state.conservative_history`, `current_conservative_response`, `latest_speaker=\"Conservative\"`","x":320,"y":980,"width":280,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"neut","type":"text","text":"**Neutral Analyst**\n_quick LLM_\n→ `risk_debate_state.neutral_history`, `current_neutral_response`, `latest_speaker=\"Neutral\"`","x":640,"y":980,"width":280,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"cond_risk","type":"text","text":"**`should_continue_risk_analysis`**\n\n```\nif count >= 3*max_risk_discuss_rounds: → Portfolio Manager\nelif latest_speaker.startswith(\"Aggressive\"):   → Conservative Analyst\nelif latest_speaker.startswith(\"Conservative\"): → Neutral Analyst\nelse:                                            → Aggressive Analyst\n```\nOrdine effettivo: Trader → Aggressive → Conservative → Neutral → Aggressive → ...","x":0,"y":1160,"width":920,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"schema_pd","type":"text","text":"**`PortfolioDecision`**\n\n- `rating: PortfolioRating`\n- `executive_summary: str`\n- `investment_thesis: str`\n- `price_target?: float`\n- `time_horizon?: str`\n\n`render_pm_decision` → markdown\n(Rating / Executive Summary / Investment Thesis)","x":1620,"y":920,"width":360,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"pm","type":"text","text":"**Portfolio Manager**\n_**deep LLM**_\n\nLegge: 4 report + `investment_plan` + `trader_investment_plan` + `risk_debate_state` + `past_context`\n\nOutput strutturato: `PortfolioDecision`\n→ writes `final_trade_decision`\n→ writes `risk_debate_state.judge_decision`","x":1180,"y":1100,"width":320,"height":240,"color":"2"},
